OL,3,AOpenAI agents get rebrand - as 'dots' -
OL,4,Awhile safety worries delay new model
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI has chosen to rename new
OL,7,Fversions of artificial intelligence
OL,8,Ftools widely known as agents. They are
OL,9,Fnow being called "dots."
OL,11,FCompany boss Sam Altman, speaking in
OL,12,FSan Francisco on Tuesday during
OL,13,FOpenAI's yearly event for technology
OL,14,Fdevelopers, referred to "dots" as
OL,15,F"remarkably capable, always-on agents
OL,16,Fthat can handle really anything you can
OL,17,Fthink of."
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
